Subject: [PATCH 162/224] [A13] Adding hcall to be called from
 bstcommandprocessor

---
 .../com/bluestacks/os/BstHostCallManager.java  | 11 +++++++++++
 .../com/bluestacks/os/IBstHostCallService.aidl |  1 +
 .../bluestacks/server/BstHostCallService.java  |  9 +++++++++
 ...om_bluestacks_server_BstHostCallService.cpp | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 39 insertions(+)

